cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EverAlgo in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "EverAlgo: a stateless algorithm library for memory extraction and ranking"
abstract: >-
  EverAlgo is the algorithm library behind EverMind's memory system. It provides stateless,
  storage-free operators for two symmetric paths — Extract (structured units to structured
  memories) and Rank (multi-route recall candidates to a ranked memory list) — distributed as
  eight packages sharing the everalgo.* namespace.
type: software
